\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Head of Thy church, whose Spirit fills
\par And flows through every faithful soul,
\par Unites n mystic love, and seals
\par Them one, and sanctifies the whole:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come, Lord! Thy glorious Spirit cries;
\par And souls beneath the alter groan;
\par Come, Lord! The bride on earth replies;
\par And perfect all our souls in one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Pour out the promised gifts on all,
\par Answer the universal; Come!
\par The fullness of the Gentiles call,
\par And take Thine ancient people home.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. To Thee let all the nations flow,
\par Let all obey the gospel word;
\par Let all their suffering Saviour know,
\par Filled with the glory of the Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O for Thy truth and mercy's sake
\par The purchase of Thy passion claim!
\par Thine heritage, the nations, take,
\par And cause the world to know Thy name. 
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

